---
const communities = ['Red Deer', 'Lacombe', 'Ponoka', 'Wetaskiwin', 'Leduc', 'Edmonton'];
---

<section id="service-area" class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-8">
		<div class="lg:col-span-7">
			<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary">Service Area</p>
			<h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
				Excavation services across Central Alberta.
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				Skyline Excavating works with homeowners, acreage owners, builders, and property managers throughout Central Alberta. If
				your project is in Central Alberta, there is a good chance it falls inside the regular service area.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				That includes excavation, grading, demolition, driveway removal, augering, and dirt haul-off for projects that need an
				organized site, dependable scheduling, and direct communication from the first call through the final cleanup.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-5">
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-canvas p-6 shadow-card">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Communities commonly served</h3>
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
					{
						communities.map((community) => (
							<li>{community}</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
